  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "description": "Thin wrapper: fires the schedule, calls FastAPI's /run-scan, which does all real business logic (connector discovery -> normalize -> AI intent extraction -> qualification -> matching -> policy -> content generation -> approval queue). No business logic lives in this workflow."
